//============================================================================
//Rule : Endpoint - Defender - AMSI Malicious Script Blocked
//MITRE : T1059.001 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell)
//Data Source : DeviceEvents (MDE)
//Prerequisite : MDE onboarded, AMSI enabled (預設開啟)
//Type : 偵測 AMSI 在記憶體層阻擋的惡意 PowerShell 內容
//Severity : HIGH - AMSI 成功阻擋 shellcode loader / bypass 嘗試
//Known FP : 安全工具的誤報（如 PowerSploit 測試）
//Tuning : 關聯 InitiatingProcessCommandLine 確認攻擊意圖
//Note : 本 lab 中 MDE AMSI 成功阻擋多次 PowerShell shellcode loader，
//       包含字串混淆、char array 混淆版本，偵測訊號已驗證
//============================================================================
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType == "AmsiScriptDetection"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    DeviceName,
    InitiatingProcessAccountName,
    InitiatingProcessFileName,
    InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
    AdditionalFields
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
